1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
 when we would turn to Heavenly Father in prayer.

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,420
 While serving at Syria 70,

3
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:07,320
 I attended the state conference in Cote d'Ivoire.

4
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:09,820
 After the start of the adult session,

5
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:13,320
 the state president and I decided to visit a sister

6
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:15,680
 who is battling cancer.

7
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:19,060
 When we asked how she was feeling,

8
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:22,800
 she said something that remains with me to this day.

9
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:27,660
 As I pray daily, I realize that the Savior loves me.

10
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:34,200
 I see his hands all around me, telling me, my daughter, all is well.

11
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:39,300
 As we pray in faith, our spiritual immunity will be strengthened.

12
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:48,540
 The body we carry may not always be removed, but our backs will be built to carry the Lord's grace upon it.

13
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:51,340
 Third, sacrament.

14
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:53,080
 The sacrament is a gift.

